summary: tests clevis pkcs#11 AF_UNIX socket daemon security properties
description: |
    Verify that clevis-pkcs11-afunix-socket-unlock daemon:
    1. Does not crash on unbound client connections (CVE-2026-109976)
    2. Creates sockets with restrictive permissions (CVE-2026-109969)
    3. Does not log LUKS passphrases in plaintext (CVE-2026-109968)
component:
  - clevis
test: ./runtest.sh
recommend:
  - clevis
  - clevis-pin-pkcs11
  - socat
  - softhsm
  - opensc
  - procps-ng
duration: 10m
enabled: true
tag:
  - CI-Tier-1
  - NoRHEL4
  - NoRHEL5
  - NoRHEL6
  - NoRHEL7
  - NoRHEL8
  - TIPfail_Security
  - Tier1
  - Tier1security
  - TierCandidatesFAIL
tier: '1'
extra-summary: /CoreOS/clevis/Sanity/pkcs11/afunix-socket-security
extra-task: /CoreOS/clevis/Sanity/pkcs11/afunix-socket-security
adjust:
  - enabled: false
    when: distro == rhel-4, rhel-5, rhel-6, rhel-7, rhel-8
    continue: false
id: a1b2c3d4-5e6f-7890-abcd-ef1234567890
